  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960212,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Greetings: A Commodore 64 Party Game\n\nStep right up and prepare to greet the challenge in *100 Greetings* for the Commodore 64! This lively party game draws inspiration from the classic TV show, *The $100,000 Pyramid*, offering a unique blend of wordplay and quick thinking.\n\nThe goal is simple: climb the pyramid to victory! Each round presents a category filled with words linked by a common theme – perhaps \"animals,\" \"sports,\" or \"foods.\" One player acts as the clue-giver, desperately trying to guide their partner to guess the hidden words without uttering them directly. Clever clues and sharp deduction are essential!\n\n*100 Greetings* supports both two-player competitive mode, faithfully recreating the Pyramid experience, and a solo mode for practicing your clue-giving skills.  Expect vibrant Commodore 64 graphics and a catchy soundtrack to enhance the fun. Gather your friends and family, and prepare for a hilarious and engaging word game experience! Can you conquer the pyramid and shout \"Greetings!\" at the top of your lungs?"
    },
